<title>USA: Accent Color names Patrick Pedonti as CEO.</title>
<headline>Accent Color names Patrick Pedonti as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HARTFORD, Conn 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accent Color Sciences Inc said Wednesday it had appointed Patrick Pedonti as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Pedonti, who held the same position at Chemprene Inc, will replace Stephen Henn, who has decided to leave the company to pursue other interests, it said.  </p>
<p>Accent Color makes color printing systems for digital, high-speed, black-on-white printers and accessories.</p>
</text>
